sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant S as Rug server
  participant O as OPA
  A->>G: rug.save_note
  G->>S: tools/list
  S-->>G: benign description
  G->>G: pin the hash
  G->>O: allow
  O-->>G: allow
  G->>S: save_note
  Note over S: description is replaced
  A->>G: rug.save_note again
  G->>S: tools/list
  S-->>G: different description
  G->>O: drift true
  O-->>G: deny
  G-->>A: deny, alert stored
